    "name": {
      "zh": "Super Famicom",
      "en": "Super Famicom (SNES)"
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1990,
    "manufacturer": "Nintendo",
    "category": "game-console",
    "description": "1990 年任天堂推出的 16 位家用游戏机，以 Mode 7 缩放旋转与采样音源定义了一代画面与音乐，是 16 位时代巅峰。",
    "authors": [
      {
        "name": "箱庭电子博物馆项目组",
        "role": "author"
      }
    ],
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Super Famicom 是任天堂于 1990 年推出的 16 位家用游戏机，是 Famicom 的正统继承者，也是 16 位时代的巅峰之作。它以 Mode 7 旋转缩放与 S-SMP 采样音源，把游戏画面带进油画时代、把游戏音乐带进交响时代，靠超级马力欧世界、塞尔达、最终幻想等封神之作，成为 16 位时代最畅销主机。",
      "en": "The Super Famicom is a 16-bit home console released by Nintendo in 1990, the successor to the Famicom and the peak of the 16-bit era. With Mode 7 rotation/scaling and the S-SMP sample audio, it brought games into the era of painterly graphics and symphonic music, becoming the best-selling console of the generation."
    },
    "sources": [
      {
        "type": "documentation",
        "title": "Wikipedia: Super NES",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_Nintendo_Entertainment_System",
        "license": "cc",
